<titlePage type="main">       <titlePart type="main">Der<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g #b">Studentencongreß<lb/>
zu Eisenach</hi><lb/>
am 25. September 1848</titlePart><lb/>
<titlePart type="sub"><hi rendition="#b">seine Bedeutung und seine Resultate</hi></titlePart><lb/>
<byline>von<lb/>
<docAuthor><hi rendition="#b">Karl Schurz</hi></docAuthor><hi rendition="#b">.</hi></byline><lb/>
